lify uh their role  iran's doing very very little compared  to the russians  iran appears to have sent out some  direct emails to people  in florida but it doesn't seem to be  very well  written it doesn't seem to be very  effective i can  only imagine that the reason for that  press conference  uh is that the president has been  yelling at his various subordinates to  do something  uh and when he heard that iran was  doing anything he probably yelled at  radcliffe hold a press conference today  tonight and say it's not just russia  it's iran  all right richard clark thank you so  much for joining us we'll be watching  what happens next week and hope to talk  to you more about this  coming up this week's winners and losers  in the media as chosen by mediate  see if you agree with what they have to  say about the president's daughter  ivanka you're watching brian ross  investigate  time now for this week's winners and  losers in the media as chosen by the  editors at mediaite  and we're joined by the editor-in-chief  of mediaite aidan mclaughlin  meteorite which select law and crime  trial network is all part of the dan  abrams media empire  and aiden the first choice for the  winner this week jake tapper of cnn for  his interview with the white house chief  of staff mark meadows  here's a key clip from that interview  we're not going to control the pandemic  we are going to control the fact that we  get vaccines therapeutics and other  mitigations what are we going to get  because it is a contagious virus just  like the food but why not make  efforts to contain it well we are making  efforts to contain it by running all  over the country not wearing a mask  that's what the vice president is doing  and aiden that made headlines around the  world  yeah so it was a pretty stunning  omission from uh  mark meadows who is the donald trump's  chief of staff um  you have to remember the context of this  uh interview it comes on a weekend  when it was revealed that a number 